{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/FinishPolicy","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Who finishes a StoreKit transaction, and when."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/SQ","doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/SH","doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"FinishPolicy"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Finishing tells the App Store that the app has delivered what was bought. For a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"consumable that is the end of the road: a finished consumable is gone from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Transaction.unfinished"},{"type":"text","text":" and is never redelivered. If the app finishes it before its own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"server has credited the purchase, and the request to that server is then lost, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"customer has paid for something that nobody will ever hand over."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Set once, in "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/PurchasesManager\/configure(identifiers:finishing:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"W